request.description:
Attempts to register with an email that already exists.

Expected Response: 409 Conflict
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "An account with email 'sophia.patel@campusconnect.edu' already exists."
}

Sends an invalid role ('superadmin'). Only 'student' and 'admin' are allowed.

Expected Response: 400 Bad Request
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "Validation failed.",
  "validation_errors": {
    "role": "Role must be one of: admin, student."
  }
}

Sends a body with only email — all other required fields are missing.

Expected Response: 400 Bad Request
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "Validation failed.",
  "validation_errors": {
    "name": "Name is required.",
    "password": "Password is required.",
    "role": "Role is required."
  }
}

Sends a password shorter than 8 characters.

Expected Response: 400 Bad Request
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "Validation failed.",
  "validation_errors": {
    "password": "Password must be at least 8 characters."
  }
}

Registers a new CampusConnect administrator account.

Expected Response: 201 Created
{
  "success": true,
  "message": "Account created successfully. Welcome to CampusConnect, Dr. Sarah Jenkins!",
  "user": {
    "id": "<uuid>",
    "name": "Dr. Sarah Jenkins",
    "email": "sarah.jenkins@campusconnect.edu",
    "role": "admin",
    "created_at": "..."
  }
}

Accesses the protected dashboard with a valid student JWT token.

Prerequisite: Run 'Login Student' first and set {{student_token}}.

Expected Response: 200 OK
{
  "success": true,
  "dashboard": {
    "user": { "id": "...", "name": "Sophia Patel", "email": "...", "role": "student" },
    "welcome_message": "Welcome back, Sophia Patel! Your CampusConnect academic dashboard is ready.",
    "permitted_actions": ["view_own_profile", "view_courses", ...],
    "portal_sections": [...],
    "system_info": { "campus": "...", "semester": "...", "token_expires_at": "..." }
  }
}

Attempts to access the protected dashboard with NO Authorization header.

Expected Response: 401 Unauthorized
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "Authorization header missing or malformed. Provide: Authorization: Bearer <token>"
}

Sends a completely invalid/malformed JWT token string.

Expected Response: 401 Unauthorized
{
  "success": false,
  "error": "Invalid token: ..."
}

Uses a valid admin JWT token to access the admin event management panel.

Prerequisite: Set {{admin_token}} from 'Login Admin'.

Expected Response: 200 OK
{
  "success": true,
  "admin_panel": {
    "message": "Admin event management panel — CampusConnect.",
    "admin_email": "sarah.jenkins@campusconnect.edu",
    "events_summary": { ... },
    "management_actions": [...],
    "linked_api": { ... }
  }
}
